{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Available Types"}], "prev": {"link": "../MessageOrigin/", "title": "MessageOrigin"}, "next": {"link": "../MessageOriginHiddenUser/", "title": "MessageOriginHiddenUser"}, "title": "MessageOriginUser", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"messageoriginuser\">\n<h1>MessageOriginUser<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#messageoriginuser\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.types.MessageOriginUser\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.types.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">MessageOriginUser</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.types.MessageOriginUser\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>The message was originally sent by a known user.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>date</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/library/datetime.html#datetime.datetime\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">datetime</span></code></a>) \u2013 Date the message was sent originally in Unix time</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>sender_user</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../User/#pyrogram.types.User\" title=\"pyrogram.types.User\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">User</span></code></a>) \u2013 User that sent the message originally</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"]